::Q001::[markdown]ἔλυσας:{
	~%100%aorist (1) active indicative 2nd sing. of the verb “I loosen”#Correct: **ἔλυσας** is aorist (1) active indicative 2nd sing. of the verb “I loosen” (Chapter 2).
